        {
            "heading": "Strategy",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "In order to deal with dynasty characters with negative genetic traits , the following actions may be taken into account:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "If descendants are in the line of succession : The player could try to disqualify them from succession",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "If descendants are not in the line of succession : It is much easier to just arrange a marriage into other important dynasties , which also has the possibility of introducing the defect into those dynasties' gene pools. In the long term, this \"infection\" has the potential to erode their power through generations of dysgenic leaders.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Alternatively,  if no options for disinheritance is available, one might attempt to liquidate the unprofitable assets.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Summary",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Avoid marriages among close relatives; ensure that the groom and bride at least do not share any grandparent",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Avoid marriages with spouses bearing negative genetic traits",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Look for candidates of marriage who possess positive genetic traits",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Should the player happens upon a negative genetic traits , it is possible to marry spouses with positive traits opposite in effect to it (e.g., Quick as opposed to Slow ), for it will decrease the chance of heirs receiving a large hit to their stats .",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
